title: 'Decided by Jeff: the set is recomputed at each press; "next" is the first perspective ranked after the current one, else the root authors''.'
pid: f5dff62f-fcef-4971-b9c6-877bf2c13f6f
body: |2-
  His words: "let's do recompute the set of perspectives in it at each
  such request". A switch changes what is drawn, and the graph changes
  between presses. Since the ranks are fixed, a current perspective that
  has left the set (a save can name one, or the graph changed) is
  followed by the next one still in it, and the root authors' are always
  reached. Built so: 'perspective_after' in
  'server/serve/handlers/overrides_followed.rs'.
